# Trust root for `Mutation-Gate-Reviewed:` trailers (spec R26, R28).
# `git verify-commit` reads this file (gpg.ssh.allowedSignersFile) from the base branch.
# Format: <principal> namespaces="git" sk-ssh-ed25519@openssh.com <base64 public key>
# Only `sk-ssh-ed25519@openssh.com` keys without `no-touch-required` may appear here;
# tests/test_mutation_gate_allowed_signers.py enforces it.
# The operator enrols their key before merge (V7). Until then the file has no key
# line, so nothing verifies and every trailer is ignored (fails closed).
